{"title":"강호, 미치다!","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=dQPtg/hAd4dX70Yu/YQzS0a9Io8yCYHpLJVz2Tk&filename=th3","synopsis":"하류 인생을 살아가는 모자란 반푼이 이묵.\n그는 상납 관계에 있는 무림 문파에게 당해 생사지경을 오가게 된다. \n\n그때 마침 광독을 만나 살아남고, 놀라운 신체개조과정을 거쳐 무림 문파를 상대하다가 문파의 뿌리인 화산에게 추적당한다. 결국 광독이 중얼거렸던 말을 떠올리고 기련산으로 유령 신마의 무공을 취하려 떠나게 되는데..\n\n몇 년 후, 이전과는 완전히 다른 초월적 존재로 돌아온 이묵.\n화산에 향한 그의 미친 강호가 시작된다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":208,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":174,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":186,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":176,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":156,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":173,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":210,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":254,"change":{"type":"down","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":290,"change":{"type":"down","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":220,"change":{"type":"up","amount":70}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":170,"change":{"type":"up","amount":50}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":209,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":184,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":177,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":203,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":227,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":212,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":162,"change":{"type":"up","amount":50}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":286,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":255,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":175,"change":{"type":"up","amount":80}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":163,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-09-01","r